{
  "work_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci",
  "source_path": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci.json",
  "source_language": "chu",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29": {
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-10-29",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "c6cfcea639865248",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "March 30. The life of the venerable father John, abbot of the holy mountain of Sinai."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "348cfeeeca07e9ae",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He was surnamed Scholasticus. As for the place that gave birth to and raised this noble man"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "4a0c7bea0fff6304",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "before he became a monk—an earthly city, wonderful, so to speak—I have no need to speak of it."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "b93247af3fceb11d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But as for the city that has now received this marvelous man and nourishes him with immaterial food,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "c7b9073f9b006f7f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I am not ignorant of it; rather, I know it very well. For he too is now in that city"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "d90f283319005342",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of which Paul cries out with a loud voice, saying, “Their citizenship is in heaven.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "8c07dced4f927200",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Satisfying his insatiable hunger with immaterial food and beholding the beauty of the invisible God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "46228b5f48754e1c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as he contemplates and marvels with his understanding mind alone, he has received gifts worthy of his labors"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "a8e88421ee770a0e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and crowns, having been numbered among those with whom he remains forever, whose feet stand firm in uprightness."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "71c1b897c8ea0222",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And how he came to stand there among immaterial beings, though himself material, I will explain plainly."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.136v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "51b16a2ee989452f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed man was sixteen years old in age, but a thousand years old in intellectual"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "2676a2e10653a7c6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "skill, when he presented himself like a pure, freely offered sacrifice to the great High Priest,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "75ab8ca21fafb108",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "bringing his body to Mount Sinai,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "757de657ecb92367",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "but his soul to the heavenly mountain, as I believe, even from that very place, to the great but invisible [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "ce9a3c65bfbaa86b",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He intended to gain guidance and progress; and while living there, he embraced great humility."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "9de92959b362e5bb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He cut off all his own desires and bowed his neck in humility."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "15ca9617a0ddebcf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Thus he willingly put himself completely to death, as though he had a soul without reason or a will of its own,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "dc04e743e407457e",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "his natural disposition having been entirely changed. And what is more marvelous"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "30528dab85130f20",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "is that, despite his great wisdom, through a simple and humble life"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "c254795ba7c2d9dc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he drove away pride in his wisdom. Then, after nineteen years,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "b0fc977fa81305a0",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "having sent his teacher ahead to the heavenly King as an ambassador and intercessor,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "7d90337c7dd90dda",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he went out to a place of silence, carrying the abbot’s prayers in his hand like a weapon to strengthen himself."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "808f47a5c2915678",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He settled in a place five stadia away from the monastery. The name of that place was Tholas."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137r.s13",
      "source_sha256": "390814a6bf4cbecf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He spent forty years living there without weariness, burning with love and divine"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "efa5d73570e42409",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "fire continually blazing within him. And who is capable of describing in words his virtues and labors?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "201d20c44f082753",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "which he did while living there. Nevertheless, I will recount at least a little of this blessed man's beginnings."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "28f08f484311789d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of his good resolve. He ate a little of everything, but very little indeed."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "021432414b8b83b6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for the sake of the commandment, not so that he might take pride in it, but so that he might always remain humble."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "0169001ff5df1b62",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He kept himself from every kind of oil [?], at all times."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "a64c2ae2f17560ce",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "By reflecting on death, he roused his soul to greater labors. Through obedience he cut off the hostility of the tormentor as with a sword."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "9f431b4806e74861",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Through seclusion and silence he put to death glory, which is flimsier than a spider's web."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "5d671718a1e22a2a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And how shall I recount the crowns he wove for himself in our time by pouring out tears?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "29d163049b19ae6c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Their secret work continues even to this day in a cave a short distance from his cell."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "4d34e9f8d301c2ef",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There he would always sit and weep with tears, crying out and wailing loudly,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "b5aa6264f307a343",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as though someone had had his eyes gouged out with a weapon. He took only as much sleep"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "09ab73967c98ec0d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "as was needed to avoid losing his mind through sleeplessness. Above all, before sleeping he would offer prayers and read books."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.137v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "d53846efdd4a7073",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this alone gave him relief from despondency. His course was unceasing prayer,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "724b107c917fe12d",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and his love for God was beyond measure. For night and day, beholding him in the purity of his own life as in a mirror,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "6b7b00d23d90bb38",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he could never have his fill. A certain Moses, one of the monks there, seeking to imitate his way of life,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "8b1873931f9dd268",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "begged the abbot to have John take him in, so that he might become his disciple."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "4f9b59cc2dead4f7",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The abbot prevailed upon him by pleading with him, and he took him in, and Moses stayed with him. One day,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "d7bf8e9a6fe7be22",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Father John ordered Moses to go to a certain place, dig a ditch, and divert the water"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "7cfd487f28473fa9",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and bring it to water the vegetables. When he reached the appointed place, he carried out his orders diligently."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "08ac9332da9c80fe",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "When the midday heat came, Moses lay down beneath a large rock and rested in sleep."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "614ea9a62c680394",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But the Lord, who does not wish harm upon his servants, intervened as usual. For while the wise father was in his cell"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "f32d23c31c9bb93f",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "offering prayers to God, he grew drowsy and slept a little."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "0829bc5101e1fd02",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he saw someone in priestly splendor waking him, reproaching him for sleeping, and saying, “John, how can you sleep without a care,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "a24a171b76c6d9b6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "while Moses is in great danger?” He immediately sprang up and prayed for his disciple."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "40c816537ad508e2",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Then, when he returned in the evening, he asked him, “Did anything bad happen to you?”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "9f98e09c5eec03bf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He replied, “A large rock nearly crushed me while I was resting beneath it at midday.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "76ea69f0ec539efa",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "if he had not suddenly called out to me, so that I came to my senses and leaped away. But the truly humble father,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "e19703cee32488c3",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "without telling anything of what he had seen, secretly praised the good God. He was also an example"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s4",
      "source_sha256": "bb31dafff4efcebf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and a healer of invisible wounds. Once, for example, a certain man named Isaac,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s5",
      "source_sha256": "180ad3dcd7c07619",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "severely oppressed by the burden of a lustful demon and brought to despair, hurried to this wise father."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s6",
      "source_sha256": "db268493de4c73b8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "With tears and cries, he confessed the wound caused by his struggle."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s7",
      "source_sha256": "6f7000631d6a42c4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The blessed man, marveling at his faith, said, “Let us stand in prayer, my friend.”"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s8",
      "source_sha256": "04e09ffaa1de93db",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And as the words of the prayer were coming to an end, while the suffering man was still lying face down,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s9",
      "source_sha256": "d2ee05e93a8decdb",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "the Lord, who fulfills the wishes of those who please him, heard the prayers of his servant"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s10",
      "source_sha256": "ded39628972f66fc",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and eased that brother’s struggle. Both gave thanks to the Lord God. But some, goaded by envy,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s11",
      "source_sha256": "f54a7c5ddf7e3f8a",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "called him a talker and a babbler. He taught them a lesson through his actions,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s12",
      "source_sha256": "54dbde543a559bd6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "showing everyone that he could do all things through Christ, who gave him strength in everything."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.138v.s13",
      "source_sha256": "618b654c181eafaf",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He remained silent for an entire year, saying nothing to anyone, so that his detractors became petitioners, saying"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s1",
      "source_sha256": "0621239b4136adf5",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that the ever-flowing spring had been closed and everyone’s salvation had perished. Yielding to their pleas,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s2",
      "source_sha256": "93e48caf0aee47e6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he resumed his former way of life. Then everyone, marveling at all his achievements,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s3",
      "source_sha256": "1ba025078d46c565",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "raised him to leadership over the brothers, as though he were a newly appeared Moses,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s4",
      "source_sha256": "ec9a6dc81c39310c",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "placing the lamp on the chief lampstand. These good judges had considered the matter, and they were not mistaken."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s5",
      "source_sha256": "1cf7ccaf53ab5074",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For he too ascends the mountain and, passing through the impenetrable darkness, receives"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s6",
      "source_sha256": "457c90d38bc2de79",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "a divinely patterned law, being led upward by spiritual steps. And, seeing [?], he opens his mouth to the word of God,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s7",
      "source_sha256": "89ccf30c7ddebca8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "draws in the Spirit, and pours forth a word and sayings, and good things from the treasury of his heart."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s8",
      "source_sha256": "76e088b2c80f7499",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He reaches the end of his visible life while guiding the Israelite monks,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s9",
      "source_sha256": "cca0f63f5a97fd03",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "differing from Moses in only one thing: as for entrance into the Jerusalem above,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s10",
      "source_sha256": "e967a1244d11af91",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "he was not deprived of it as Moses was somehow deprived of entrance into the one below. Many bear witness to this,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s11",
      "source_sha256": "9e1b41fdd1edbff6",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "who have been saved and are being saved through him. The valiant new David is a witness to the wise man’s wisdom and salvation."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139r.s12",
      "source_sha256": "3e086b5b7618dff8",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Our venerable pastor John is also a good witness. At his request, as a memorial, from Mount"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139v.s1",
      "source_sha256": "a58ada9601ddfe32",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Sinai this new seer of God descended to us in spirit, and he too showed us his tablets written by God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139v.s2",
      "source_sha256": "5834d9fcbdc984e4",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "Outwardly, then, active, but inwardly contemplative."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "ccmh-supr/vita-ioannis-climaci#Supr.139v.s3",
      "source_sha256": "f40a79f30e0ffc27",
      "provenance": "gpt-6.1-sol/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-10-29",
      "group_size": 2,
      "text": "Having assurance, saying this: Glory to our God, now and always and forever and ever. Amen."
    }
  ]
}
